---
// The close-month flow: two steps in parallel, a gated report, a conditional publish.
---
<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 230" role="img" aria-label="A flow: collect-sales and collect-costs run in parallel, then report waits for a person, then publish runs only if the report says so">
    <defs>
      <marker id="fa" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L8 4L0 8z" fill="#697080"/></marker>
    </defs>
    <g stroke="#14171f" stroke-width="1.2" fill="#fff">
      <rect x="20" y="30" width="170" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="20" y="130" width="170" height="52" rx="8"/>
      <rect x="290" y="80" width="170" height="52" rx="8" fill="#fffbeb" stroke="#92600a"/>
      <rect x="560" y="80" width="170" height="52" rx="8" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
    </g>
    <g font-size="14" font-weight="600" fill="#14171f" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="105" y="61">collect-sales</text>
      <text x="105" y="161">collect-costs</text>
      <text x="375" y="111">report</text>
      <text x="645" y="111">publish</text>
    </g>
    <g font-size="12" fill="#697080" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="105" y="199">no after: both start at once</text>
      <text x="375" y="150" fill="#92600a">gate: approval human</text>
      <text x="645" y="150">when report contains APPROVED</text>
    </g>
    <g stroke="#697080" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fa)">
      <path d="M190 56H240Q290 56 290 96"/><path d="M190 156H240Q290 156 290 116"/><path d="M460 106H558"/>
    </g>
    <g stroke="#0e6b5c" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"><path d="M20 12H190" /></g>
    <text x="205" y="16" font-size="12" fill="#0e6b5c">journal: each step written before and after it runs</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Run it again with the same run id after a crash or an approval: finished steps are not run again.</figcaption>
</figure>
